SUMMARY:Fall Family Fun at Oregon Dairy Farmstead
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate America’s 250th Birthday!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCorn Maze and other Farm Activities\nDates & Hours\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nOpening Weekend Hours: \nSat. Sept. 12 from 10:00am – 10:00pm\nSun. Sept. 13 from 10:00am – 6:00 pm \nHours from Sept. 18 – October 30 \nFridays and Saturdays:  10:00am – 10:00pm\nSundays:  10:00am – 6:00pm\nOpen Columbus Day\, October 12 from 10:00 – 6:00 \nLast day for the season:  Saturday\, October 31 with special hours from 10:00 – 6:00 \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n*Last admission onto the farm is 1 hour prior to closing. \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nTickets & Pricing\n\n\n\n\nAdmission Includes: \n\n\n\n\nCorn Maze\, Wagon Ride to Pumpkin Patch\, Barrel Train Rides\, Jump Pad\, Pedal Tractors/Trikes\, Tire Pull and lots of yard games \n\n\n\n\nAdmission Prices (at the gate): \nAges 3 – 64:  $15.00/person \nAges 65 and older:  $13.00/person \nGroups of 15 or more:  $14.00/person \nBarnyard Express Train Ride:  $5.00/person ages 3 and up \n\n\n\n\nPurchase Tickets Here\n\n\n\n\n  \nSPECIAL FRIDAY PRICING**** at the gate:  $8.00/person (ages 3 and up) between the hours of 10:00 – 4:00 only
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/fall-family-fun-oregon-dairy-farmstead/
