SUMMARY:Holly Jolly Jukebox at Magic & Wonder
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the season with a joyful\, high-energy holiday spectacular bursting with music\, nostalgia\, and breathtaking wonder! Journey into Toyland\, where imagination comes alive in vibrant\, whimsical style—and even Santa and Mrs. Claus get in on the fun. Enjoy audience-favorite hits from White Christmas\, then travel back in time as we recreate a 1940s holiday radio show complete with a heartfelt military tribute and classics like “I’ll Be Home for Christmas.” Feel the excitement soar with a spellbinding aerial performance set to the powerful sounds of Trans-Siberian Orchestra\, and wrap it all up with a dazzling finale that fills the theater with the warmth and spirit of the holidays. Perfect for guests of every age\, this magical Christmas experience is sure to make your season shine. \n\nCome Explore Our Lancaster Theaters and the Arts\n\n\nLive Theater\nLive Entertainment\nLive Music\n\n\n\nDinner Theaters\nMurder Mysteries\nThings To Do\n\n\n\nArtisan Collectives\nArt Galleries\nEvents Calendar
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/magic-wonder-holly-jolly-jukebox/
