SUMMARY:Halloween Weekend Deal at Laserdome
DESCRIPTION:Halloween Weekend at Laserdome\nLooking for Halloween fun that doesn’t depend on the weather? Laserdome in Manheim is taking $20 off its All Day Pass on Saturday\, October 31 and Sunday\, November 1. That drops the pass from $69.99 to $49.99 per person\, so you can spend the holiday weekend on laser tag missions\, holographic adventures and the arcade without watching the clock. \nWhat the All Day Pass includes\n\nUnlimited Laser Tag: play as many sessions as you want in a 9\,000 square foot\, two-level arena with fog and neon cover\nUnlimited Verse Immersive: walk through life-size holograms in an AR theater. There’s no VR headset\, so you see your group the whole time\nFree Unlimited Arcade: included with every pass\, a $24.99 value\n\nDon’t miss Trick r Treat: Laserdome’s holographic haunted house is part of the Verse lineup and fits the weekend perfectly. You walk through four spooky locations\, and every candy you pick up and pumpkin you touch decides whether you make it out. \nHalloween weekend is one of Laserdome’s busiest times and sessions can sell out\, so reserve ahead. Reservations come with a refundable deposit\, and booking online gets every player 100 bonus prize points at check-in. \nMake a day of it: Add the pizza and drink package when you reserve online and save $5.49 per person. Trick-or-treating Saturday night? Come early in the day and still make it home in time. \nKnow before you go.\n\nWhen: Saturday\, October 31 and Sunday\, November 1\, 2026. Saturday 11 AM to 11 PM\, Sunday 11 AM to 10 PM\nWhere: Laserdome\, 2050 Auction Road\, Manheim\, PA 17545\nCost: $49.99 per person for the All Day Pass (regularly $69.99)\n\nMore info: Laserdome
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/halloween-weekend-deal-at-laserdome/
LOCATION:Laserdome\, 2050 Auction Rd\, Manheim\, PA\, 17545\, United States
CATEGORIES:Autumn,Children & Family Events,Halloween,Holiday,Manheim
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/webp:https://lancasterpa.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/arcade-gallery-.webp
