SUMMARY:Yummie's Boo Bash - Kitchen Kettle Village
DESCRIPTION:Spend a fun morning creating spook-tacular memories at Kitchen Kettle Village!\nDon’t miss our fun\, family-friendly fall event on Saturday\, October 31st\, 2026\, with check-in at 9:30am. \nPut some “happy” in your Halloween with a visit to Kitchen Kettle Village\, where you and your family can enjoy a meal\, some colorful characters\, including Yummie\, a costume contest\, a scavenger hunt\, special treats\, and more. \nSeatings are by reservation at 9:30am at The Kling House Restaurant. \nCreate cherished family memories bound to get you in the festive fall spirit! This event includes: \n\nDelicious buffet breakfast in The Kling House Restaurant from 9:30am – 10:30am\nGingerbread man cookie decorating promptly following breakfast\nPhoto opportunities with Yummie & mascot friends. Don’t forget your camera!\nSpooktacular scavenger hunt for the kids throughout the Village with exclusive surprises and treats\nCostume Contest with cash prizes at the stage area for all children beginning at 11am\nFamilies will love the buffet featuring:\nScrambled Eggs\nHam\nSausage\nFrench Toast Sticks\nBreakfast Potatoes\nFresh Fruit\nYogurt\nBeverages: Hot Chocolate\, Coffee\, Juice\n\nPlus\, don’t miss the scarecrow stilt walker from 10am-Noon. \nAll children under 18 years old attending the event may participate in the Costume Contest. \nTickets are required for this special event and slots fill up quickly. Book online or call 1-800-732-3538 to reserve your spot!
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/kitchen-kettle-village-yummies-boo-bash/
