SUMMARY:Make-Believe Masquerade Ball
DESCRIPTION:YOU’RE INVITED to the Make-Believe Masquerade Ball! A celebration fit for superheroes\, magical creatures\, kings and queens! \nStep into a world of imagination and join us for a very special Halloween! \nCome dressed in your favorite costume and get ready for an enchanting day filled with music\, dancing\, creativity\, and plenty of opportunities to make magical memories. \n\nDance the day away at the DJ Dance Party\nShow off your costume in the Costume Parade\nStrike a pose at our magical photo ops\nGet creative and inquisitive with themed STEM and Art activities\n\nWhether you’re a fairy or a dinosaur\, princess or superhero\, all costumes are welcome at the ball! (Please keep costumes family-friendly) \nChoose your Celebration Time: \nMorning Ball: 10:00am – 12:00pm \nAfternoon Ball: 12:30pm – 2:30pm
