SUMMARY:Live Music with Kevin Raubenstine at Cherry Crest Adventure Farm
DESCRIPTION:Check out our amazing lineup of musicians that will be performing live right here at the farm! \nJoin us on select Friday evenings and Saturdays for toe-tapping tunes from our favorite bands. \nKevin’s performances move seamlessly from alternative rock to classic staples\, with a style that makes every song feel fresh. His covers aren’t copies — they’re reimagined with nuance and confidence\, giving familiar tracks a new edge. \n\nAdditional Fun Things To Do in Lancaster?\n\n\nKids’ Attractions\nFamily Attractions\nAmish Attractions\n\n\n\nThings To Do for Adults\nHistorical & Educational\nIndoor Things To Do\n\n\n\nTheater\, Music\, & The Arts\nMud Sales\nEvents Calendar\n\n \nTake a look at many more Things To Do throughout Lancaster County!
