SUMMARY:Live Music with The Stu Huggens Band at Cherry Crest Adventure Farm
DESCRIPTION:Check out our amazing line up of musicians that will be performing live right here at the farm! \nJoin us select Friday evenings and Saturdays for toe tapping tunes from our favorite bands. \nStu Huggens\, is a legend in central Pennsylvania\, regarded as the one of the very top country vocalists he brings his band of top notch musicians to present a wide variety of country classics as well contemporary and originals. \nMajor influences for Stu are Merle Haggard\, Johnny Cash\, Nitty Gritty Dirt Band\, Bill Monroe\, George Jones. And lets not forget George Strait\, Alan Jackson. Joe Nichols\, Clint Black for keeping country Country. \n\nAdditional Fun Things To Do in Lancaster?\n\n\nKids’ Attractions\nFamily Attractions\nAmish Attractions\n\n\n\nThings To Do for Adults\nHistorical & Educational\nIndoor Things To Do\n\n\n\nTheater\, Music\, & The Arts\nMud Sales\nEvents Calendar\n\n \nTake a look at many more Things To Do throughout Lancaster County!
