SUMMARY:Halloween at West Art!
DESCRIPTION:With The Nielsen Family Band\, Health Club\,\nand Jon from Jon Smith’s Voyages\n  \nWest Art and the Nielsen Family Band continue their holiday tradition in 2026 with a very special Halloween show. Come spin the wheel of covers with the Nielsen Family Band and help to determine their setlist live in real-time. That’s right\, the Nielsens are bringing a carnival wheel to the stage in West Art’s Sanctuary for an interactive Halloween show like no other. As if this weren’t enough of a spooky spectacle\, NFB will be joined by their and your favorite avant-garde\, performance art rockers Health Club. Opening the show is a special solo performance from Jon Smith of Jon Smith’s Voyages. And of course\, we’ll be hosting our annual costume contest\, so come dressed for success!
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/halloween-at-west-art/
LOCATION:West Art\, 816 Buchanan Ave\, Lancaster\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Autumn,Entertainment,Halloween,Holiday,Lancaster City,Live Music
